        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001",
          "SHOT-002"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-002",
        "start": 4.92,
        "end": 9.48,
        "text": "在现场体验了不少京东云出品的神器，比如零代码做app和agent",
        "representativeTime": 7.2,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-002.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-002",
          "SHOT-003"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-003",
        "start": 9.49,
        "end": 13.527,
        "text": "但最让我惊艳的是这些已经上岗直播带货的京东数字人",
        "representativeTime": 11.508,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-003.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-003",
          "SHOT-004"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-004",
        "start": 13.527,
        "end": 17.97,
        "text": "这些数字人已经有超过一万家品牌都在用，一年带货超过一百四十亿",
        "representativeTime": 15.748,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-004.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-004"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-005",
        "start": 17.98,
        "end": 21.74,
        "text": "想想你最近买的那些东西，说不定都是ai卖给你的，说实话啊",
        "representativeTime": 19.86,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-005.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-004",
          "SHOT-005",
          "SHOT-006",
          "SHOT-007"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-006",
        "start": 21.74,
        "end": 26.77,
        "text": "我知道京东在电商加ai上憋大招，但没想到他们把数字人做到了这么逼真",
        "representativeTime": 24.255,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-006.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
